i-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<ol><li>Obtain the following materials:\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/Yellow_Rock_Candy\" title=\"Yellow Rock Candy\">Yellow Rock Candy</a> (Must be Forged)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Winter_Star\" title=\"Winter Star\">Winter Star</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Golden_Sleigh_Bell\" title=\"Golden Sleigh Bell\">Golden Sleigh Bell</a></li></ol></li>\n<li>Go to the <a href=\"/wiki/Santa%27s_Workshop\" title=\"Santa&#39;s Workshop\">Santa's Workshop</a>(Placed correctly, it will create a particle effect.)\n<ol><li>Place the <a href=\"/wiki/Winter_Star\" title=\"Winter Star\">Winter Star</a> on the altar<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/17/Use_Winter_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20251214022124\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Use Winter Star\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/17/Use_Winter_Star.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251214022124\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"139\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Use Winter Star.png\" data-image-key=\"Use_Winter_Star.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Use_Winter_Star.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>Place the <a href=\"/wiki/Yellow_Rock_Candy\" title=\"Yellow Rock Candy\">Yellow Rock Candy</a> on the altar<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/ba/Use_Yellow_Rock_Candy.png/revision/latest?cb=20251214022510\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Use Yellow Rock Candy\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/ba/Use_Yellow_Rock_Candy.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251214022510\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"156\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Use Yellow Rock Candy.png\" data-image-key=\"Use_Yellow_Rock_Candy.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Use_Yellow_Rock_Candy.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>Plave the <a href=\"/wiki/Golden_Sleigh_Bell\" title=\"Golden Sleigh Bell\">Golden Sleigh Bell</a> on the altar<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/ff/Use_Golden_Sleigh_Bell.png/revision/latest?cb=20251214022629\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Use Golden Sleigh Bell\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/ff/Use_Golden_Sleigh_Bell.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251214022629\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"174\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Use Golden Sleigh Bell.png\" data-image-key=\"Use_Golden_Sleigh_Bell.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Use_Golden_Sleigh_Bell.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>Go to the top floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Santa%27s_Workshop\" title=\"Santa&#39;s Workshop\">Santa's Workshop</a>.</li></ol></li>\n<li>Take your Golden Solstice Staff<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c7/Take_Gloden_Solstice_Staff.png/revision/latest?cb=20251214023054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Take Gloden Solstice Staff\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"264\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Take Gloden Solstice Staff.png\" data-image-key=\"Take_Gloden_Solstice_Staff.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c7/Take_Gloden_Solstice_Staff.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251214023054\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c7/Take_Gloden_Solstice_Staff.png/revision/latest?cb=20251214023054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Take Gloden Solstice Staff\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c7/Take_Gloden_Solstice_Staff.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251214023054\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"264\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Take Gloden Solstice Staff.png\" data-image-key=\"Take_Gloden_Solstice_Staff.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c7/Take_Gloden_Solstice_Staff.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251214023054\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Take_Gloden_Solstice_Staff.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li></ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903001303\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 41/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 59/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function cou